        <description>Fiddle bridge wire schema 2: typed Off (On+64) and revision beacon on KS126/KS127. Note durations pinned to 100% (written lengths). Pending Dorico host acceptance. Orchestral pitched percussion: 24 conduits, 25 bases, 52 add-ons. Specification SHA256: ef0102c4be05a3b271ee73387f173a71d6a4ca8167cc11ef2234ac1f36b83875</description>
